olor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Award nominations</span></li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack prose\" style=\"--flow:1rem\" data-reveal=\"right\">\n        <h3 class=\"mt-0\">How this route is built</h3>\n        <p>Our entertainment & media route combines national and international newswires with sector trade press, regional desks in the metros that matter to you, and the AI answer engines that handle industry questions. You choose the tier; we handle the routing.</p>\n        <p>Reviews are handled by editors who work this beat, which matters most when a claim needs qualifying or a number needs a source.</p>\n        <p><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"distribution.html\">How distribution routing works <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.25rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\" data-reveal>\n      \n<div class=\"callout callout-takeaways\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Key takeaways</strong>\n  <ul><li>Median first pickup for entertainment & media releases: 38 minutes on priority plans.</li><li>2,600+ sector-relevant outlets, plus AI answer engines on every plan.</li><li>Specialist editorial review — not a generic queue.</li><li>Metro and country-level targeting included at no extra cost.</li></ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Answers</p>\n        <h2>Entertainment & Media distribution questions</h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-3 muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Still stuck? <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to a specialist <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\" data-accordion=\"single\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">How quickly can a tour announcement go out?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Same day on standard plans. Announcements tied to ticket on-sale times can be scheduled to publish at a precise minute.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you support music and film separately?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, with distinct outlet lists for music press, film trade and streaming/tech entertainment media.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can independent artists use PressCosmos?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, and the Launch plan is designed for exactly this. One release, properly formatted, at a price an independent can absorb.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you require